1
00:00:00,993 --> 00:00:05,463
(Leonard:)You have no idea
how much you inconvenience

2
00:00:05,464 --> 00:00:06,834
(Leonard:)the lives of everyone
around you.

3
00:00:06,832 --> 00:00:08,802
It's exhausting!

4
00:00:08,801 --> 00:00:10,371
(Sheldon:)You know what?

5
00:00:10,369 --> 00:00:12,369
(Sheldon:)You think you're so tolerant,

6
00:00:12,371 --> 00:00:14,301
(Sheldon:)but the truth is...

7
00:00:14,306 --> 00:00:16,476
(Sheldon:)you're mean to me a lot.

8
00:00:16,475 --> 00:00:17,805
(Sheldon:)Yeah,
you think

9
00:00:17,810 --> 00:00:19,340
(Sheldon:)that I don't notice
all those sarcastic comments

10
00:00:19,345 --> 00:00:21,845
(Sheldon:)and those eye rolls,
but I do. Hmm?

11
00:00:21,847 --> 00:00:24,377
(Amy:)I have
excellent peripheral vision.

12
00:00:25,818 --> 00:00:29,418
(Sheldon:)On a good day,
I can see my ears.

13
00:00:30,656 --> 00:00:33,486
Sheldon, I-I'm sorry
if I hurt your feelings.

14
00:00:33,492 --> 00:00:36,322
(Leonard:)I've been holding a lot
of this in for a while.

15
00:00:36,328 --> 00:00:37,998
(Sheldon:)Well, I'm sorry, too.
And if you want

16
00:00:37,997 --> 00:00:40,497
(Sheldon:)to live with Penny,
then I think you should.

17
00:00:40,499 --> 00:00:42,169
(Leonard:)Do you mean that?

18
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:44,537
(Sheldon:)Yes. Yeah, just put
on your squeaky shoes and...

19
00:00:44,536 --> 00:00:46,906
(mimics squeaking)
your way out of my life.

20
00:00:49,675 --> 00:00:51,675
(Leonard:)Come on, don't get upset.

21
00:00:51,677 --> 00:00:53,877
(Sheldon:)I'm not upset.

22
00:00:53,879 --> 00:01:00,019
(Sheldon:)I'm just imagining a world
without my best friend in it.

